  "text": "### Step 2: Investigation (Days 2–5)  \n**Information Gathering:**\n- Review account records\n- Check transaction history\n- Review relevant procedures/policies\n- Interview involved staff (if applicable)\n- Assess policy compliance  \n**Documentation:**\n- Record all findings\n- Note policy/procedure applicable\n- Determine if FirstUK Bank at fault\n- Quantify financial loss (if any)",
